    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84938" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ̆-κλαυστος</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ̆-κλαυτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
